		{"id":"n-monorepo","type":"file","file":"Monorepo & Toolchain.md","x":920,"y":610,"width":760,"height":110},
		{"id":"n-buildorder","type":"text","text":"## 🧭 Recommended Build Order (high level)\n\n1. Bare Moon workspace\n2. **Identity service** — Better Auth, PlayerProfile, Org, Membership, Billing foundation\n3. `packages/auth` + `packages/billing` + `packages/identity`\n4. **Club Manager** (first product, full stack end-to-end)\n5. **Coach** (second product)\n6. **AI Assistant** (third product, pgvector)\n7. Admin Dashboard (platform routes)\n8. Mobile apps (Flutter) — UI over existing APIs\n9. Production — swap Ollama → Claude, deploy DBs, Nginx, CI/CD\n\n→ Full detail: [[Monorepo & Toolchain]] · [[shared]]","x":0,"y":800,"width":1720,"height":260},
